  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish requirements for obtaining and maintaining a license to sell lottery games on behalf of the New Hampshire lottery commission.\n\nSource. #14474, eff 1-7-26, EXPIRES 1-7-36",
